cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "cpm-lineage: a platform-agnostic optimisation and diagnosis framework for CPM-billed ad platforms"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that decomposes a return-on-ad-spend move on a CPM-billed ad
  platform exactly into conversion, selling price and CPM, attributes it to
  levers, and builds a reviewable plan of typed actions. It ships with synthetic
  data only; its thresholds are judgment defaults.
authors:
